 "title": "Drivers License Schedule | Sioux County, Iowa",
 "text": "Drivers License Schedule | Sioux County, Iowa\nSkip to content\nMenu Elected Officials Attorney – Legal Counsel, Criminal Prosecution, Juvenile Justice\nAuditor – Tax Rates & Levies, Budgets, Real Estate Transfers\nRecorder – Real Estate Records, Permits, Licenses\nTreasurer – Vehicle Registrations, Driver’s Licenses, Tax Statements\nSheriff – Law Enforcement, Jail, Comm Center\nClose\nDepartments Assessor\nAttorney\nAuditor\nClerk of Court\nPublic Health\nConservation Board\nElections\nEmergency Management\nEngineer\nCommunity Services\nGIS Parcel Search\nGIS\nInformation Technology\nRecorder\nSheriff\nSupervisors\nTreasurer\nVeterans Affairs\nZoning\nClose\nI Want To Get directions to county offices\nLearn about the community\nGet Certified copy of: Birth, Death, or Marriage Certificate\nLicense my boat, snowmobile, ATV\nLearn about Home Base Iowa\nLearn about TITLE VI\nRenew Drivers License\nPassport Application\nApply for a gun permit\nFind the assessed value of my home or business\nGet a map of my property\nRequest GIS Data\nPay my Taxes\nSearch Paid Taxes\nGet Election Information\nRegister to Vote\nFind election results\nRequest an Absentee Ballot\nClose\nMenu Departments Assessor\nAttorney\nAuditor\nClerk of Court\nPublic Health\nConservation Board\nElections\nEmergency Management\nEngineer\nCommunity Services\nGIS Parcel Search\nGIS – Geographic Information Systems\nInformation Technology\nRecorder\nSheriff\nSupervisors\nTreasurer\nVeterans Affairs\nZoning\nClose\nOnline Services Assessment Search\nGIS Website\nProperty Tax Payments\nMotor Vehicle Registration\nPublic Access to Local Government Budgets\nDriver’s License Appointments\nClose\nElections\nMinutes\nAbout\nContact\nI Want To Get directions to county offices\nLearn about the community\nGet Certified copy of: Birth, Death, or Marriage Certificate\nLicense my boat, snowmobile, ATV\nApply for a gun permit\nFind the assessed value of my home or business\nGet a map of my property\nPay my Taxes\nGet Election Information\nRegister to Vote\nPast Election Results\nLearn about Home Base Iowa\nClose\nDriver's License Schedule\nYou can now schedule your appointment online to renew/obtain your driver’s license.\nSchedule Appointment\nSioux County Drivers License\nTreasurer's Office\n211 Central Ave SE, Orange City\nPh. 712-737-8430\nPlease make an appointment online @IowaDOT.gov\nMONDAY\nHours: 8:00 am – 4:30 pm\nTUESDAY\nHours: 9:00 am – 4:30 pm\nWEDNESDAY\nCLOSED\nTHURSDAY\nHours: 8:00 am – 4:30 pm\nFRIDAY\nHours: 8:00 am – 4:30 pm\nOur doors are open until 4:30, however all transactions must be started before 3:45!\nThere is no testing, Real ID Issuance or Out of State Transfers after 3:30.\nYou have 30-days before and 60-days after the expiration date to renew your license.\nAll drive tests are done by appointment only.\nWe do not do CDL or Motorcycle drive test.\nYou may also go onto the www.iowadot.gov website to see if you are eligible for online renewal, Skip the Trip at Home Permit testing applications and the list of documents required for the Real ID. We encourage you to make an appointment online for any DOT service center or county treasurer office.\n210 Central Ave SW\nPO Box 18\nOrange City, IA 51041\n712-737-2216\n© 2026 Sioux County, Iowa • Website by Blue Lake Websites",
